---
/**
 * About.astro
 * About section — professional summary, career story, values.
 * Tech-first framing with education as a strength.
 */
---
 
<section class="about section section--muted" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
 
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 class="section-header__title" id="about-heading">
        Building systems that work for people
      </h2>
      <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="about__grid">
 
      <div class="about__primary">
        <p>
          I'm a software engineer based in the UK, building full-stack
          applications and data-driven systems that are accessible, reliable, and
          genuinely usable in real-world contexts.
        </p>
        <p>
          My background spans software engineering, education leadership, and digital
          learning design, including an MA in Digital Education. This gives me a
          research-informed perspective on how structured information supports
          understanding. Also how good system design can reduce friction for the people
          who use it.
        </p>
        <p>
          I work across the full stack, applying
          testing, secure coding, and structured architecture to deliver maintainable
          solutions. Accessibility and inclusion aren't considerations I layer on at
          the end: they're part of how I approach every decision.
        </p>
      </div>
 
      <aside class="about__values" aria-label="Core values">
        <h3 class="about__values-heading">What I care about</h3>
        <ul role="list" class="about__values-list">
          <li class="about__value">
            <span class="about__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Accessibility-first</strong>
              <p>Designing for everyone from the start, not as an afterthought.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="about__value">
            <span class="about__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            <div>
              <strong>User-centred systems</strong>
              <p>Software that reduces cognitive load and works well under real conditions.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="about__value">
            <span class="about__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Clear, maintainable code</strong>
              <p>Readable solutions built to last, not just to ship.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="about__value">
            <span class="about__value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Inclusion by design</strong>
              <p>Building with disabled, neurodivergent and chronically ill users in mind.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
 
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<style>
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
  }
 
  @media (min-width: 56em) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 18rem;
      gap: var(--space-16);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
 
  /* Primary text */
  .about__primary p {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
 
  /* Values sidebar */
  .about__values {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    border: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }
 
  .about__values-heading {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
 
  .about__values-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    list-style: none;
  }
 
  .about__value {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
 
  .about__value-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.4;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
 
  .about__value strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }
 
  .about__value p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
 
